    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[A reading desk in the afternoon]]></title>
      <link>https://wordpress.example/reading-desk/</link>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[writer]]></dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The desk does not need to be perfectly clear. It needs enough room for an open book and somewhere to leave a pencil.</p><figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="/demo/reading-desk.svg" alt="A book and cup on a sunlit reading desk" width="960" height="600"><figcaption>A sample illustration included with this starter.</figcaption></figure><h2>Reading slowly</h2><p>I leave the phone in another room and read until a passage asks me to pause. Sometimes I copy it out. More often I just look through the window.</p><h3>Notes in the margin</h3><p>A question mark is often more useful than a summary. It gives me somewhere to begin when I return to the page.</p>]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[A book, a clear corner of the desk, and an hour without a plan.]]></excerpt:encoded>
