    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Keeping a small reading list]]></title>
      <link>https://wordpress.example/small-reading-list/</link>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[writer]]></dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>My reading list used to grow faster than I could read it. I now keep three sections and let each one stay short.</p><h2>On the desk</h2><ul><li>One book I am reading.</li><li>One essay I want to discuss.</li><li>One poem to read aloud.</li></ul><h2>For later</h2><p>If a recommendation still interests me after a month, it earns a place. There is no need to turn every passing curiosity into an obligation.</p><h2>Finished, but not done</h2><p>The best books keep finding their way back to the desk.</p>]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[A short shelf of things to return to, instead of an endless queue.]]></excerpt:encoded>
