    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[About this preview]]></title>
      <link>https://wordpress.example/about/</link>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[editor]]></dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This is a ZeroPress site built from a WordPress export. Replace the sample XML with your own export to see your writing here.</p><h2>A familiar blog</h2><p>Read a post, browse a category, or follow the three-level header menu. On a small screen, the menu button keeps those same destinations within reach.</p><h2>Still your content</h2><p>Your original media URLs and WordPress comment service stay in use throughout the trial. Sample names, categories, and menus disappear when you replace the export.</p>]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[A place to try your WordPress writing in a different theme.]]></excerpt:encoded>
