    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Colophon]]></title>
      <link>https://wordpress.example/about/colophon/</link>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[writer]]></dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This sample uses the Blog theme from ZeroPress. Its light and dark colors share the same layout and system fonts.</p><h2>Illustrations</h2><figure><img src="/demo/type-study.svg" alt="A typographic specimen from the sample collection" width="960" height="600"><figcaption>Two small illustrations are included in public/demo/ for the sample articles.</figcaption></figure><h2>Under the surface</h2><p>WordPress exports are converted into static HTML. Pagefind adds a search index during production builds, so visitors do not need a search account or an API key.</p>]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Notes on the type, illustrations, and search used in this preview.]]></excerpt:encoded>
